{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">酷熱天氣警告繼續生效。今日日間市區最高氣溫約34度，新界再高兩三度，部分地區極端酷熱。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HOT-0700.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026rHez3nuVx41786491631.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HOT-0700.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台科學主任梁浩明表示︰「到早上六時，香港大部分地區氣溫已經在29度或以上，高溫天氣持續。在這裡提提大家，酷熱天氣警告仍然生效，大家謹記要做足防暑防曬措施。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HOT-0700_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20265kq7wIfPkd1786491635.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HOT-0700_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台，指一股西南氣流會在今明兩日影響廣東沿岸，該區天氣仍然酷熱，亦有幾陣驟雨。周末期間短暫時間有陽光，有幾陣驟雨。而受高空擾動影響，周五及周六華南天氣不穩定，驟雨增多。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T23:59:54.621288+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}